---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Contact Us | wrongfulterminationcalc.com"
  description="Contact the WrongfulTerminationCalc editorial team with questions, corrections, or feedback. We do not provide legal advice."
>

  <h1>Contact Us</h1>

  <p>
    Have a question about our content, a correction to report, or feedback on the calculator? We want to hear from you.
  </p>

  <h2>Email</h2>
  <p>
    Reach our editorial team at: <a href="mailto:hey@theclicklab.agency">hey@theclicklab.agency</a>
  </p>

  <h2>What We Can Help With</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Corrections or updates to factual content on the site</li>
    <li>Questions about our methodology or calculator logic</li>
    <li>Suggestions for guides or topics we should cover</li>
    <li>Media and editorial inquiries</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What We Cannot Help With</h2>
  <p>
    <strong>We are not a law firm and cannot provide legal advice.</strong> We cannot review your specific situation, tell you whether you have a case, or recommend attorneys. If you are looking for legal help with a wrongful termination situation, we encourage you to:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Contact a licensed employment attorney in your state — many offer free initial consultations and work on contingency for wrongful termination cases</li>
    <li>Reach out to your state bar's lawyer referral service</li>
    <li>Contact the EEOC at <a href="https://www.eeoc.gov" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">eeoc.gov</a> if you believe you have a discrimination or retaliation claim</li>
    <li>Contact your state's department of labor or human rights commission for state-law claims</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Response Time</h2>
  <p>
    We aim to respond to all editorial inquiries within 3–5 business days. We are a small team, and we cannot guarantee a response to every message, but we read everything we receive.
  </p>

  <p>
    WrongfulTerminationCalc is published by The Click Lab. Business address: online business — correspondence by email only.
  </p>

</BaseLayout>
